WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.108
Quiet Staff helps small businesses put AI

00:00:03.118 --> 00:00:06.029
to work. We're building Quiet Staff One

00:00:06.159 --> 00:00:09.273
to make everyday work easier, with intelligence

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:11.021
shaped around your business.

00:00:13.262 --> 00:00:16.259
Quiet Desk uses AI to understand WhatsApp

00:00:16.269 --> 00:00:19.633
and Gmail enquiries, prepare informed replies

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:22.175
and bring important decisions to your team.

00:00:26.273 --> 00:00:28.980
Quiet Studio turns ideas into content for

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:32.335
LinkedIn, Facebook and Instagram, alongside

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:35.756
newsletters and short videos, ready for review.

00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:41.481
From creating your website to capturing

00:00:41.491 --> 00:00:44.871
enquiries, Quiet Reach uses AI to shape

00:00:44.881 --> 00:00:47.576
your content and help turn interest into

00:00:47.586 --> 00:00:49.383
a useful next step.

00:00:52.273 --> 00:00:54.852
Quiet Knowledge brings intelligence from your

00:00:54.862 --> 00:00:57.871
approved Google Drive documents and policies

00:00:57.881 --> 00:01:00.750
into useful answers, with sources you can

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.465
check.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.945
Quiet Flow coordinates agreed actions across

00:01:07.955 --> 00:01:11.126
your tools. Workflows can include Slack or

00:01:11.136 --> 00:01:14.233
Telegram, with complex or sensitive decisions

00:01:14.259 --> 00:01:15.592
brought to a person.

00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:20.465
Start with what your business needs.

00:01:20.909 --> 00:01:22.768
Quiet Staff One will grow

00:01:22.778 --> 00:01:25.306
with more capabilities and modules.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.058
AI that works for your business.
